#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json
#. Description of the 'Book Deferred Entries Based On' (Select) field in
#. DocType 'Accounts Settings'
msgid ""
"If \"Months\" is selected, a fixed amount will be booked as deferred "
"revenue or expense for each month irrespective of the number of days in a "
"month. It will be prorated if deferred revenue or expense is not booked for "
"an entire month"
msgstr ""
"Si «Mois» est sélectionné, un montant fixe sera comptabilisé en tant que "
"revenus ou dépenses différés pour chaque mois, quel que soit le nombre de "
"jours dans un mois. Il sera calculé au prorata si les revenus ou les "
"dépenses différés ne sont pas comptabilisés pour un mois entier"

#: erpnext/setup/doctype/company/company.json
#. Description of the 'Reconcile on Advance Payment Date' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Company'
msgid ""
"If <b>Enabled</b> - Reconciliation happens on the <b>Advance Payment "
"posting date</b><br>\n"
"If <b>Disabled</b> - Reconciliation happens on oldest of 2 Dates: "
"<b>Invoice Date</b> or the <b>Advance Payment posting date</b><br>\n"
msgstr ""
"Si <b>activé</b> - Le rapprochement se fait à la <b>date de "
"comptabilisation de l'acompte</b><br>\n"
"Si <b>désactivé</b> - Le rapprochement se fait à la plus ancienne des 2 "
"dates : <b>date de facture</b> ou <b>date de comptabilisation de "
"l'acompte</b><br>\n"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/loyalty_program/loyalty_program.js:14
msgid ""
"If Auto Opt In is checked, then the customers will be automatically linked "
"with the concerned Loyalty Program (on save)"
msgstr ""
"Si l'option adhésion automatique est cochée, les clients seront "
"automatiquement liés au programme de fidélité concerné (après "
"l'enregistrement)"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/journal_entry_account/journal_entry_account.json
#. Description of the 'Cost Center' (Link) field in DocType 'Journal Entry
#. Account'
msgid "If Income or Expense"
msgstr "Si Produits ou Charges"

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/operation/operation.js:32
msgid "If an operation is divided into sub operations, they can be added here."
msgstr ""
"Si une opération est divisée en sous-opérations, elles peuvent être "
"ajoutées ici."

#: erpnext/stock/doctype/warehouse/warehouse.json
#. Description of the 'Account' (Link) field in DocType 'Warehouse'
msgid ""
"If blank, parent Warehouse Account or company default will be considered in "
"transactions"
msgstr ""
"Si ce champ est vide, le compte d'entrepôt parent ou la valeur par défaut "
"de la société sera pris en compte dans les transactions"

#: erpnext/buying/doctype/buying_settings/buying_settings.json
#. Description of the 'Bill for Rejected Quantity in Purchase Invoice' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Buying Settings'
msgid ""
"If checked, Rejected Quantity will be included while making Purchase "
"Invoice from Purchase Receipt."
msgstr ""
"Si coché, la quantité rejetée sera incluse lors de la création d'une "
"facture d'achat à partir d'un reçu d'achat."

#: erpnext/selling/doctype/sales_order/sales_order.json
#. Description of the 'Reserve Stock' (Check) field in DocType 'Sales Order'
msgid "If checked, Stock will be reserved on <b>Submit</b>"
msgstr "Si coché, le stock sera réservé lors de la <b>soumission</b>"

#: erpnext/stock/doctype/pick_list/pick_list.json
#. Description of the 'Scan Mode' (Check) field in DocType 'Pick List'
msgid ""
"If checked, picked qty won't automatically be fulfilled on submit of pick "
"list."
msgstr ""
"Si coché, la qté prélevée ne sera pas automatiquement honorée lors de la "
"soumission de la liste de prélèvement."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/shipping_rule/shipping_rule.json
#. Description of the 'Tax is included in the price' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Shipping Rule'
msgid "If checked, tax will be deducted from shipping amount"
msgstr "Si coché, la taxe sera déduite du montant de livraison"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/purchase_taxes_and_charges/purchase_taxes_and_charges.json
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/sales_taxes_and_charges/sales_taxes_and_charges.json
#. Description of the 'Considered In Paid Amount' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Purchase Taxes and Charges'
#. 'Sales Taxes and Charges'
msgid ""
"If checked, the tax amount will be considered as already included in the "
"Paid Amount in Payment Entry"
msgstr ""
"Si coché, le montant de la taxe sera considéré comme déjà inclus dans le "
"montant payé de l'écriture de paiement"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/purchase_taxes_and_charges/purchase_taxes_and_charges.json
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/sales_taxes_and_charges/sales_taxes_and_charges.json
#. Description of the 'Is this Tax included in Basic Rate?' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Purchase Taxes and Charges'
#. DocType 'Sales Taxes and Charges'
msgid ""
"If checked, the tax amount will be considered as already included in the "
"Print Rate / Print Amount"
msgstr ""
"Si cochée, le montant de la taxe sera considéré comme déjà inclus dans le "
"Taux / Prix des documents (PDF, impressions)"

#: erpnext/public/js/setup_wizard.js:57
msgid ""
"If checked, we will create demo data for you to explore the system. This "
"demo data can be erased later."
msgstr ""
"Si coché, nous créerons des données de démonstration pour vous permettre "
"d'explorer le système. Ces données pourront être supprimées ultérieurement."

#: erpnext/support/doctype/warranty_claim/warranty_claim.json
#. Description of the 'Service Address' (Small Text) field in DocType 'Warranty
#. Claim'
msgid "If different than customer address"
msgstr "Si différente de l'adresse du client"

#: erpnext/setup/doctype/global_defaults/global_defaults.json
#. Description of the 'Disable In Words' (Check) field in DocType 'Global
#. Defaults'
msgid "If disable, 'In Words' field will not be visible in any transaction"
msgstr "Si coché, le champ 'En Lettre' ne sera visible dans aucune transaction"

#: erpnext/setup/doctype/global_defaults/global_defaults.json
#. Description of the 'Disable Rounded Total' (Check) field in DocType 'Global
#. Defaults'
msgid "If disable, 'Rounded Total' field will not be visible in any transaction"
msgstr "Si coché, le champ 'Total Arrondi' ne sera visible dans aucune transaction."

#: erpnext/stock/doctype/pick_list/pick_list.json
#. Description of the 'Ignore Pricing Rule' (Check) field in DocType 'Pick
#. List'
msgid ""
"If enabled then system won't apply the pricing rule on the delivery note "
"which will be create from the pick list"
msgstr ""
"Si activé, le système n'appliquera pas la règle de tarification sur le bon "
"de livraison créé à partir de la liste de prélèvement"

#: erpnext/stock/doctype/pick_list/pick_list.json
#. Description of the 'Pick Manually' (Check) field in DocType 'Pick List'
msgid ""
"If enabled then system won't override the picked qty / batches / serial "
"numbers / warehouse."
msgstr ""
"Si activé, le système ne remplacera pas la qté prélevée / lots / numéros de "
"série / entrepôt."

#: erpnext/buying/doctype/request_for_quotation/request_for_quotation.json
#. Description of the 'Send Document Print' (Check) field in DocType 'Request
#. for Quotation'
msgid "If enabled, a print of this document will be attached to each email"
msgstr "Si activé, une impression de ce document sera jointe à chaque email"

#: erpnext/selling/doctype/selling_settings/selling_settings.json
#. Description of the 'Enable Discount Accounting for Selling' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Selling Settings'
msgid ""
"If enabled, additional ledger entries will be made for discounts in a "
"separate Discount Account"
msgstr ""
"Si cette option est activée, des écritures de grand livre supplémentaires "
"seront effectuées pour les remises dans un compte de remise séparé."

#: erpnext/buying/doctype/request_for_quotation/request_for_quotation.json
#. Description of the 'Send Attached Files' (Check) field in DocType 'Request
#. for Quotation'
msgid ""
"If enabled, all files attached to this document will be attached to each "
"email"
msgstr ""
"Si activé, tous les fichiers joints à ce document seront joints à chaque "
"email"

#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json
#. Description of the 'Do Not Update Serial / Batch on Creation of Auto Bundle'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Stock Settings'
msgid ""
"If enabled, do not update serial / batch values in the stock transactions "
"on creation of auto Serial \n"
" / Batch Bundle. "
msgstr ""
"Si activé, ne pas mettre à jour les valeurs de n° de série / lot dans les "
"transactions de stock lors de la création d'un lot automatique de n° de "
"série\n"
" / lot. "

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json
#. Description of the 'Create Ledger Entries for Change Amount' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'Accounts Settings'
msgid ""
"If enabled, ledger entries will be posted for change amount in POS "
"transactions"
msgstr ""
"Si cette option est activée, des écritures de grand livre seront "
"enregistrées pour le montant de la modification dans les transactions POS."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pos_profile/pos_profile.json
#. Description of the 'Disable Rounded Total' (Check) field in DocType 'POS
#. Profile'
msgid "If enabled, the consolidated invoices will have rounded total disabled"
msgstr "Si activé, les factures consolidées auront l'arrondi du total désactivé"

#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json
#. Description of the 'Allow Internal Transfers at Arm's Length Price' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Stock Settings'
msgid ""
"If enabled, the item rate won't adjust to the valuation rate during "
"internal transfers, but accounting will still use the valuation rate."
msgstr ""
"Si activé, le taux de l'article ne s'ajustera pas au taux de valorisation "
"lors des transferts internes, mais la comptabilité utilisera toujours le "
"taux de valorisation."

#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json
#. Description of the 'Validate Material Transfer Warehouses' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Stock Settings'
msgid ""
"If enabled, the source and target warehouse in the Material Transfer Stock "
"Entry must be different else an error will be thrown. If inventory "
"dimensions are present, same source and target warehouse can be allowed but "
"atleast any one of the inventory dimension fields must be different."
msgstr ""
"Si activé, l'entrepôt source et l'entrepôt cible dans l'écriture de stock "
"de transfert de matériel doivent être différents sinon une erreur sera "
"générée. Si des dimensions d'inventaire sont présentes, le même entrepôt "
"source et cible peut être autorisé mais au moins un des champs de dimension "
"d'inventaire doit être différent."

#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json
#. Description of the 'Allow UOM with Conversion Rate Defined in Item' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Stock Settings'
msgid ""
"If enabled, the system will allow selecting UOMs in sales and purchase "
"transactions only if the conversion rate is set in the item master."
msgstr ""
"Si activé, le système autorisera la sélection des UdM dans les transactions "
"de vente et d'achat uniquement si le taux de conversion est défini dans la "
"fiche article."

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/production_plan/production_plan.json
#. Description of the 'Ignore Available Stock' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Production Plan'
msgid ""
"If enabled, the system will create material requests even if the stock "
"exists in the 'Raw Materials Warehouse'."
msgstr ""
"Si activé, le système créera des demandes de matériel même si le stock "
"existe dans l'« Entrepôt de matières premières »."

#: erpnext/buying/doctype/buying_settings/buying_settings.json
#. Description of the 'Set Valuation Rate for Rejected Materials' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'Buying Settings'
msgid ""
"If enabled, the system will generate an accounting entry for materials "
"rejected in the Purchase Receipt."
msgstr ""
"Si activé, le système générera une écriture comptable pour les matériaux "
"rejetés dans le reçu d'achat."

#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json
#. Description of the 'Do Not Use Batch-wise Valuation' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Stock Settings'
msgid ""
"If enabled, the system will use the moving average valuation method to "
"calculate the valuation rate for the batched items and will not consider "
"the individual batch-wise incoming rate."
msgstr ""
"Si activé, le système utilisera la méthode de valorisation par moyenne "
"mobile pour calculer le taux de valorisation des articles par lot et ne "
"tiendra pas compte du taux d'entrée individuel par lot."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/pricing_rule.json
#. Description of the 'Validate Applied Rule' (Check) field in DocType 'Pricing
#. Rule'
msgid ""
"If enabled, then system will only validate the pricing rule and not apply "
"automatically. User has to manually set the discount percentage / margin / "
"free items to validate the pricing rule"
msgstr ""
"Si activé, le système ne fera que valider la règle de tarification sans "
"l'appliquer automatiquement. L'utilisateur doit définir manuellement le "
"pourcentage de remise / marge / articles gratuits pour valider la règle de "
"tarification"

#: erpnext/stock/doctype/item/item.json
#. Description of the 'Variant Of' (Link) field in DocType 'Item'
msgid ""
"If item is a variant of another item then description, image, pricing, "
"taxes etc will be set from the template unless explicitly specified"
msgstr ""
"Si l'article est une variante d'un autre article, alors la description, "
"l'image, le prix, les taxes etc seront fixés à partir du modèle sauf si "
"spécifiés explicitement"

#: erpnext/stock/doctype/stock_settings/stock_settings.json
#. Description of the 'Role Allowed to Create/Edit Back-dated Transactions'
#. (Link) field in DocType 'Stock Settings'
msgid ""
"If mentioned, the system will allow only the users with this Role to create "
"or modify any stock transaction earlier than the latest stock transaction "
"for a specific item and warehouse. If set as blank, it allows all users to "
"create/edit back-dated transactions."
msgstr ""
"Les utilisateur de ce role pourront creer et modifier des transactions dans "
"le passé. Si vide tout les utilisateurs pourrons le faire"

#: erpnext/stock/doctype/packing_slip/packing_slip.json
#. Description of the 'To Package No.' (Int) field in DocType 'Packing Slip'
msgid "If more than one package of the same type (for print)"
msgstr "Si plus d'un paquet du même type (pour l'impression)"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json
#. Description of the 'Automatically Add Taxes from Taxes and Charges Template'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Accounts Settings'
msgid ""
"If no taxes are set, and Taxes and Charges Template is selected, the system "
"will automatically apply the taxes from the chosen template."
msgstr ""
"Si aucune taxe n'est définie et qu'un modèle de taxes et charges est "
"sélectionné, le système appliquera automatiquement les taxes du modèle "
"choisi."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/shipping_rule/shipping_rule.json
#. Description of the 'Taxable account' (Link) field in DocType 'Shipping Rule'
msgid "If not defined, it will not add tax"
msgstr "Si non défini, aucune taxe ne sera ajoutée"

#: erpnext/stock/stock_ledger.py:1990
msgid "If not, you can Cancel / Submit this entry"
msgstr "Sinon, vous pouvez annuler / soumettre cette écriture"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/pricing_rule.json
#. Description of the 'Free Item Rate' (Currency) field in DocType 'Pricing
#. Rule'
msgid "If rate is zero then item will be treated as \"Free Item\""
msgstr "Si le taux est zéro, l'article sera traité comme un « Article gratuit »"

#: erpnext/buying/doctype/buying_settings/buying_settings.json
#. Description of the 'Fixed Outgoing Email Account' (Link) field in DocType
#. 'Buying Settings'
msgid ""
"If set, the system does not use the user's Email or the standard outgoing "
"Email account for sending request for quotations."
msgstr ""
"Si défini, le système n'utilise pas l'email de l'utilisateur ni le compte "
"email sortant standard pour envoyer les demandes de devis."

#: erpnext/stock/doctype/item/item.json
#. Description of the 'Supply Raw Materials for Purchase' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Item'
msgid "If subcontracted to a vendor"
msgstr "Si sous-traité à un fournisseur"

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/work_order/work_order.js:1027
msgid ""
"If the BOM results in Scrap material, the Scrap Warehouse needs to be "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"Si la nomenclature produit des déchets, l'entrepôt de rebut doit être "
"sélectionné."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/account/account.json
#. Description of the 'Frozen' (Select) field in DocType 'Account'
msgid "If the account is frozen, entries are allowed to restricted users."
msgstr ""
"Si le compte est gelé, les écritures ne sont autorisés que pour un nombre "
"restreint d'utilisateurs."

#: erpnext/stock/stock_ledger.py:1983
msgid ""
"If the item is transacting as a Zero Valuation Rate item in this entry, "
"please enable 'Allow Zero Valuation Rate' in the {0} Item table."
msgstr ""
"Si l'article est traité comme un article à taux de valorisation nul dans "
"cette entrée, veuillez activer &quot;Autoriser le taux de valorisation "
"nul&quot; dans le {0} tableau des articles."

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/work_order/work_order.js:1046
msgid ""
"If the selected BOM has Operations mentioned in it, the system will fetch "
"all Operations from BOM, these values can be changed."
msgstr ""
"Si la nomenclature sélectionnée contient des opérations, le système "
"récupérera toutes les opérations de la nomenclature, ces valeurs peuvent "
"être modifiées."

#: erpnext/communication/doctype/communication_medium/communication_medium.json
#. Description of the 'Catch All' (Link) field in DocType 'Communication
#. Medium'
msgid ""
"If there is no assigned timeslot, then communication will be handled by "
"this group"
msgstr ""
"S'il n'y a pas d'intervalle de temps attribué, la communication sera gérée "
"par ce groupe."

#: erpnext/edi/doctype/code_list/code_list_import.js:23
msgid "If there is no title column, use the code column for the title."
msgstr ""
"S'il n'y a pas de colonne de titre, utilisez la colonne de code pour le "
"titre."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/payment_terms_template/payment_terms_template.json
#. Description of the 'Allocate Payment Based On Payment Terms' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'Payment Terms Template'
msgid ""
"If this checkbox is checked, paid amount will be splitted and allocated as "
"per the amounts in payment schedule against each payment term"
msgstr ""
"Si cette case est cochée, le montant payé sera divisé et réparti selon les "
"montants du calendrier de paiement pour chaque condition de paiement"

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/production_plan/production_plan.json
#. Description of the 'Skip Available Sub Assembly Items' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Production Plan'
msgid ""
"If this checkbox is enabled, then the system won’t run the MRP for the "
"available sub-assembly items."
msgstr ""

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/subscription/subscription.json
#. Description of the 'Follow Calendar Months' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Subscription'
msgid ""
"If this is checked subsequent new invoices will be created on calendar  "
"month and quarter start dates irrespective of current invoice start date"
msgstr ""
"Si cette case est cochée, les nouvelles factures suivantes seront créées "
"aux dates de début du mois civil et du trimestre, quelle que soit la date "
"de début de facture actuelle"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json
#. Description of the 'Submit Journal Entries' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Accounts Settings'
msgid ""
"If this is unchecked Journal Entries will be saved in a Draft state and "
"will have to be submitted manually"
msgstr ""
"Si cette case n'est pas cochée, les entrées de journal seront enregistrées "
"dans un état Brouillon et devront être soumises manuellement"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json
#. Description of the 'Book Deferred Entries Via Journal Entry' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'Accounts Settings'
msgid ""
"If this is unchecked, direct GL entries will be created to book deferred "
"revenue or expense"
msgstr ""
"Si cette case n'est pas cochée, des entrées GL directes seront créées pour "
"enregistrer les revenus ou les dépenses différés"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/payment_entry/payment_entry.py:669
msgid "If this is undesirable please cancel the corresponding Payment Entry."
msgstr ""
"Si cela n'est pas souhaité, veuillez annuler l'écriture de paiement "
"correspondante."

#: erpnext/stock/doctype/item/item.json
#. Description of the 'Has Variants' (Check) field in DocType 'Item'
msgid "If this item has variants, then it cannot be selected in sales orders etc."
msgstr ""
"Si cet article a des variantes, alors il ne peut pas être sélectionné dans "
"les commandes clients, etc."

#: erpnext/buying/doctype/buying_settings/buying_settings.js:27
msgid ""
"If this option is configured 'Yes', ERPNext will prevent you from creating "
"a Purchase Invoice or Receipt without creating a Purchase Order first. This "
"configuration can be overridden for a particular supplier by enabling the "
"'Allow Purchase Invoice Creation Without Purchase Order' checkbox in the "
"Supplier master."
msgstr ""
"Si cette option est configurée «Oui», ERPNext vous empêchera de créer une "
"facture d'achat ou un reçu sans créer d'abord une Commande d'Achat. Cette "
"configuration peut être remplacée pour un fournisseur particulier en "
"cochant la case «Autoriser la création de facture d'achat sans commmande "
"d'achat» dans la fiche fournisseur."

#: erpnext/buying/doctype/buying_settings/buying_settings.js:34
msgid ""
"If this option is configured 'Yes', ERPNext will prevent you from creating "
"a Purchase Invoice without creating a Purchase Receipt first. This "
"configuration can be overridden for a particular supplier by enabling the "
"'Allow Purchase Invoice Creation Without Purchase Receipt' checkbox in the "
"Supplier master."
msgstr ""
"Si cette option est configurée «Oui», ERPNext vous empêchera de créer une "
"facture d'achat sans créer d'abord un reçu d'achat. Cette configuration "
"peut être remplacée pour un fournisseur particulier en cochant la case "
"&quot;Autoriser la création de facture d'achat sans reçu d'achat&quot; dans "
"la fiche fournisseur."

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/manufacturing_settings/manufacturing_settings.js:10
msgid ""
"If ticked, multiple materials can be used for a single Work Order. This is "
"useful if one or more time consuming products are being manufactured."
msgstr ""
"Si coché, plusieurs articles peuvent être utilisés pour un seul ordre de "
"fabrication. Ceci est utile si un ou plusieurs produits chronophages sont "
"en cours de fabrication."

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/manufacturing_settings/manufacturing_settings.js:36
msgid ""
"If ticked, the BOM cost will be automatically updated based on Valuation "
"Rate / Price List Rate / last purchase rate of raw materials."
msgstr ""
"Si coché, le coût de la nomenclature sera automatiquement mis à jour en "
"fonction du taux de valorisation / prix de la liste prix / dernier prix "
"d'achat des matières premières."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/loyalty_program/loyalty_program.js:14
msgid ""
"If unlimited expiry for the Loyalty Points, keep the Expiry Duration empty "
"or 0."
msgstr ""
"Si vous souhaitez ne pas mettre de date d'expiration pour les points de "
"fidélité, laissez la durée d'expiration vide ou mettez 0."

#: erpnext/stock/doctype/warehouse/warehouse.json
#. Description of the 'Is Rejected Warehouse' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Warehouse'
msgid "If yes, then this warehouse will be used to store rejected materials"
msgstr "Si oui, cet entrepôt sera utilisé pour stocker les matériaux rejetés"

#: erpnext/stock/doctype/item/item.js:977
msgid ""
"If you are maintaining stock of this Item in your Inventory, ERPNext will "
"make a stock ledger entry for each transaction of this item."
msgstr ""
"Si vous maintenez le stock de cet article dans votre inventaire, ERPNext "
"créera une écriture de stock pour chaque transaction de cet article."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/payment_reconciliation/payment_reconciliation.json
#. Description of the 'Unreconciled Entries' (Section Break) field in DocType
#. 'Payment Reconciliation'
msgid ""
"If you need to reconcile particular transactions against each other, then "
"please select accordingly. If not, all the transactions will be allocated "
"in FIFO order."
msgstr ""
"Si vous devez rapprocher des transactions particulières entre elles, "
"veuillez sélectionner en conséquence. Sinon, toutes les transactions seront "
"allouées dans l'ordre FIFO."

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/production_plan/production_plan.py:975
msgid ""
"If you still want to proceed, please disable 'Skip Available Sub Assembly "
"Items' checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Si vous souhaitez quand même continuer, veuillez décocher la case « Ignorer "
"les articles de sous-assemblage disponibles »."

#: erpnext/manufacturing/doctype/production_plan/production_plan.py:1687
msgid "If you still want to proceed, please enable {0}."
msgstr "Si vous souhaitez quand même continuer, veuillez activer {0}."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/utils.py:373
msgid ""
"If you {0} {1} quantities of the item {2}, the scheme {3} will be applied "
"on the item."
msgstr ""
"Si vous {0} {1} quantités de l'article {2}, le schéma {3} sera appliqué à "
"l'article."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/pricing_rule/utils.py:378
msgid "If you {0} {1} worth item {2}, the scheme {3} will be applied on the item."
msgstr ""
"Si vous {0} {1} valez un article {2}, le schéma {3} sera appliqué à "
"l'article."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/bank_statement_import/bank_statement_import.json
#. Description of the 'Delimiter options' (Data) field in DocType 'Bank
#. Statement Import'
msgid ""
"If your CSV uses a different delimiter, add that character here, ensuring "
"no spaces or additional characters are included."
msgstr ""
"Si votre CSV utilise un délimiteur différent, ajoutez ce caractère ici, en "
"veillant à ne pas inclure d'espaces ou de caractères supplémentaires."

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/budget/budget.json
#. Option for the 'Action if Annual Budget Exceeded on MR' (Select) field in
