msgstr "Ignorer le filtre de type de bon et sélectionner les bons manuellement"

#: erpnext/projects/doctype/projects_settings/projects_settings.json
#. Label of a Check field in DocType 'Projects Settings'
msgid "Ignore Workstation Time Overlap"
msgstr "Ignorer les chevauchements de temps des stations de travail"

#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/accounts_settings/accounts_settings.json
#. Description of the 'Ignore Is Opening check for reporting' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Accounts Settings'
msgid ""
"Ignores legacy Is Opening field in GL Entry that allows adding opening "
"balance post the system is in use while generating reports"
msgstr ""
"Ignore le champ hérité « Est une ouverture » dans l'écriture GL qui permet "
"d'ajouter un solde d'ouverture après la mise en service du système lors de "
"la génération des rapports"

